# Shared DVC settings. Safe to commit -- no credentials belong in this file.
#
# The S3 bucket URL is added once, by whoever sets the bucket up:
#   dvc remote add -d storage s3://<bucket>/dvcstore
#
# Credentials are per-person and NEVER go here. Each teammate runs:
#   dvc remote modify --local storage access_key_id <their-key-id>
#   dvc remote modify --local storage secret_access_key <their-secret>
# which writes to .dvc/config.local, and that file is gitignored.
